{"id":"ce3435ba1413059b","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-c0-semigroup.md","title":"C0-Semigroup","display":"df-c0-semigroup — C0-Semigroup","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-c0-semigroup","aliases":["58-df-c0-semigroup","C0-Semigroup","Strongly Continuous Semigroup"],"display":"df-c0-semigroup — C0-Semigroup","depends_on":["[[58-df-operator]]","[[58-df-banach-space]]","[[58-df-bounded-operator]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-c0-semigroup"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-c0-semigroup</span><span>C0-Semigroup</span><span>Strongly Continuous Semigroup</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-c0-semigroup — C0-Semigroup"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5e8c7b8a7c03e2ed\" href=\"?note=5e8c7b8a7c03e2ed\" title=\"58-df-operator\">58-df-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ef59807ad934771f\" href=\"?note=ef59807ad934771f\" title=\"58-df-banach-space\">58-df-banach-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2ad9c248fe18df37\" href=\"?note=2ad9c248fe18df37\" title=\"58-df-bounded-operator\">58-df-bounded-operator</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Banach}_S\\subseteq V^5\\cup V^2\\cup V\">\\(\\mathrm{Banach}_S\\subseteq V^5\\cup V^2\\cup V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S\\subseteq V^{10}\">\\(\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S\\subseteq V^{10}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{C0SemigroupStructure}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{C0SemigroupStructure}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{C0Semigroup}_S\\subseteq V^3\\cup V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{C0Semigroup}_S\\subseteq V^3\\cup V^2\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{C0GeneratorStructure}_S\\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{C0GeneratorStructure}_S\\subseteq V^7\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Generator}_S\\subseteq V^4\\cup V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Generator}_S\\subseteq V^4\\cup V^3\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,K,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X\\in V\">\\(X,K,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Banach}_S(X,K,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\">\\(\\mathrm{Banach}_S(X,K,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\\)</span> (Banach-space structure)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S\\)</span> (fully explicit bounded-operator predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2ad9c248fe18df37\" href=\"?note=2ad9c248fe18df37\" title=\"58-df-bounded-operator\">58-df-bounded-operator</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\in (X^X)^{\\mathbb{R}_{\\geq 0}}\">\\(T\\in (X^X)^{\\mathbb{R}_{\\geq 0}}\\)</span> (operator family)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,s \\in \\mathbb{R}_{\\geq 0}\">\\(t,s \\in \\mathbb{R}_{\\geq 0}\\)</span> (times)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in V\">\\(A\\in V\\)</span> (infinitesimal generator)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{C0SemigroupStructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{C0SemigroupStructure}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{C0GeneratorStructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{C0GeneratorStructure}_S\\)</span> are the fully explicit predicates defined here</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{C0Semigroup}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{C0Semigroup}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Generator}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Generator}_S\\)</span> are compatibility projections whose omitted structure is existentially bound</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}c0\\text{-}semigroup\\text{-}structure} \\vdash \\mathrm{C0SemigroupStructure}_S(T,X,K,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Banach}_S(X,K,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\\land T\\in\\{S\\in X^X\\mid\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S(S;X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,+_X,\\odot_X;X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,+_X,\\odot_X;K)\\}^{\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}}\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(T(0)(x)=x)\\land\\forall s,t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;(T(t+s)=T(t)\\circ T(s))\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\bigl(t&lt;\\delta\\to\\|T(t)(x)+_X((-1_K)\\odot_Xx)\\|_X&lt;\\varepsilon\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}c0\\text{-}semigroup\\text{-}structure} \\vdash \\mathrm{C0SemigroupStructure}_S(T,X,K,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Banach}_S(X,K,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\\land T\\in\\{S\\in X^X\\mid\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S(S;X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,+_X,\\odot_X;X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,+_X,\\odot_X;K)\\}^{\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}}\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(T(0)(x)=x)\\land\\forall s,t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;(T(t+s)=T(t)\\circ T(s))\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\bigl(t&lt;\\delta\\to\\|T(t)(x)+_X((-1_K)\\odot_Xx)\\|_X&lt;\\varepsilon\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}c0\\text{-}semigroup\\text{-}explicit} \\vdash \\mathrm{C0Semigroup}_S(T,X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\\leftrightarrow\\exists K,+_X,\\odot_X\\in V\\;\\mathrm{C0SemigroupStructure}_S(T,X,K,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}c0\\text{-}semigroup\\text{-}explicit} \\vdash \\mathrm{C0Semigroup}_S(T,X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\\leftrightarrow\\exists K,+_X,\\odot_X\\in V\\;\\mathrm{C0SemigroupStructure}_S(T,X,K,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}c0\\text{-}semigroup\\text{-}compatibility} \\vdash \\mathrm{C0Semigroup}_S(T,X)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\|\\cdot\\|_X\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}^{X}\\;\\mathrm{C0Semigroup}_S(T,X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}c0\\text{-}semigroup\\text{-}compatibility} \\vdash \\mathrm{C0Semigroup}_S(T,X)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\|\\cdot\\|_X\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}^{X}\\;\\mathrm{C0Semigroup}_S(T,X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}c0\\text{-}generator\\text{-}structure} \\vdash \\mathrm{C0GeneratorStructure}_S(A,T,X,K,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{C0SemigroupStructure}_S(T,X,K,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\\land\\exists D\\subseteq X\\;\\Bigl(D=\\{x\\in X\\mid\\exists y\\in X\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;(t&lt;\\delta\\to\\|(t^{-1}_K\\odot_X(T(t)(x)+_X((-1_K)\\odot_Xx)))+_X((-1_K)\\odot_Xy)\\|_X&lt;\\varepsilon)\\}\\land A\\in X^D\\land\\forall x\\in D\\;\\forall y\\in X\\;\\bigl(A(x)=y\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;(t&lt;\\delta\\to\\|(t^{-1}_K\\odot_X(T(t)(x)+_X((-1_K)\\odot_Xx)))+_X((-1_K)\\odot_Xy)\\|_X&lt;\\varepsilon)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}c0\\text{-}generator\\text{-}structure} \\vdash \\mathrm{C0GeneratorStructure}_S(A,T,X,K,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{C0SemigroupStructure}_S(T,X,K,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\\land\\exists D\\subseteq X\\;\\Bigl(D=\\{x\\in X\\mid\\exists y\\in X\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;(t&lt;\\delta\\to\\|(t^{-1}_K\\odot_X(T(t)(x)+_X((-1_K)\\odot_Xx)))+_X((-1_K)\\odot_Xy)\\|_X&lt;\\varepsilon)\\}\\land A\\in X^D\\land\\forall x\\in D\\;\\forall y\\in X\\;\\bigl(A(x)=y\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;(t&lt;\\delta\\to\\|(t^{-1}_K\\odot_X(T(t)(x)+_X((-1_K)\\odot_Xx)))+_X((-1_K)\\odot_Xy)\\|_X&lt;\\varepsilon)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}c0\\text{-}generator\\text{-}explicit} \\vdash \\mathrm{Generator}_S(A,T,X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\\leftrightarrow\\exists K,+_X,\\odot_X\\in V\\;\\mathrm{C0GeneratorStructure}_S(A,T,X,K,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}c0\\text{-}generator\\text{-}explicit} \\vdash \\mathrm{Generator}_S(A,T,X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\\leftrightarrow\\exists K,+_X,\\odot_X\\in V\\;\\mathrm{C0GeneratorStructure}_S(A,T,X,K,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}c0\\text{-}generator\\text{-}compatibility} \\vdash \\mathrm{Generator}_S(A,T,X)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\|\\cdot\\|_X\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}^{X}\\;\\mathrm{Generator}_S(A,T,X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}c0\\text{-}generator\\text{-}compatibility} \\vdash \\mathrm{Generator}_S(A,T,X)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\|\\cdot\\|_X\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}^{X}\\;\\mathrm{Generator}_S(A,T,X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The canonical predicates expose the scalar field and both vector operations; the compatibility projections bind every omitted structure witness.</li>\n<li>The generator of a C0-semigroup is a closed densely defined operator.</li>\n<li>Every C0-semigroup admits constants <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\geq1\">\\(M\\geq1\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\in\\mathbb R\">\\(\\omega\\in\\mathbb R\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\|T(t)\\|\\leq Me^{\\omega t}\">\\(\\|T(t)\\|\\leq Me^{\\omega t}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The exponential formula <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(t)=e^{tA}\">\\(T(t)=e^{tA}\\)</span> holds directly when the generator is bounded; it is not an unconditional power-series representation for arbitrary generators.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Engel and Nagel, One-Parameter Semigroups for Linear Evolution Equations</li>\n<li>Pazy, Semigroups of Linear Operators and Applications to PDE</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-operator","status":"resolved","id":"5e8c7b8a7c03e2ed","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-b